menu "Sprout feature modules"

config FEATURE_PROMPT_TONE
    bool "Enable local system prompt tones"
    default y
    depends on FEATURE_AUDIO_CODEC
    help
        Generate wake, capture, error, network, battery, and safety cues
        locally. Cues go through the playback queue when it is enabled, so
        safety announcements keep their priority and cannot be silenced.

endmenu
